# The chat of a net game (of one player): a line typed and sent, a line
# with a character erased, a macro (alt and a digit), and the key that
# shows the last message again. The lines that come from other players
# need more than one, and are not here. The level starts at frame 41,
# after the wipe of the warp.
50 press t # starts a line to all
54 press h
56 press i
58 shot typing.ppm
60 press enter # sent: the player sees it
64 shot sent.ppm
100 press t
104 press x
106 press y
108 press backspace
110 shot erased.ppm
112 press enter
116 shot sent2.ppm
140 press t
144 down alt
146 press 1 # the first macro
148 up alt
152 shot macro.ppm
300 shot gone.ppm
310 press enter # again
314 shot refresh.ppm
340 quit
